"Hn'tyon Renjen-art'h was the Primary's sire, a knight among the most powerful Artonans ever."
"He fought many battles against encroaching chaos and is a hero, now acknowledged more quietly."
"He sired at least sixteen hundred children to keep knight training facilities full."
"Jeneth, Alis and Tesen were among the last children he sired."
"His facilities pushed children to first binding with no care for their suitability."
"He killed a demon whose transmogrified skin lies in a chest in the art'h supply library."
